      "vision_reason": "This is a classic suzani embroidery with dense floral medallions and multiple borders, made in Ura Tube (Ura-Tyube), a traditional Tajik embroidery center in Tajikistan — a hand-embroidered dowry textile fitting the claimed ethnicity.",
